Subject: [PATCH 05/10] bus: mhi: core: Set BHI/BHIe offsets on power up
 preparation
Date: Fri, 25 Jun 2021 18:03:50 +0530
Message-Id: <20210625123355.11578-6-manivannan.sadhasivam@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.1
